                // Specifically, op(oneshot0_complete@, inner.oneshot0_inv_half@) must be valid
                // because they have the same location.

                // From the op table, op(Complete, x) is valid only if x is Empty or Complete.
                // So inner.oneshot0_inv_half@ must be Empty or Complete.

                // But from the invariant, inner.oneshot0_inv_half@ is HalfRightToComplete or Complete.
                // The only value that satisfies both constraints is Complete.
                // Therefore, inner.oneshot0_inv_half@ is Complete.

