                // Since oneshot0_complete@ is Complete,
                // and op(Complete, HalfRightToComplete) = Invalid,
                // we conclude that inner.oneshot0_inv_half@ cannot be HalfRightToComplete.
                // Therefore, inner.oneshot0_inv_half@ is Complete.

